"A rotted and then shredded arm.  Not much use unless you want to scrape the "
"meat from the bones."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tainted limb"
#. ~ Snippet in category "leg_zed_desc"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"What's left of some zombie's limb.  Most likely a leg based on the "
"proportions.  Though it's rotted, there is quite a bit of meat still on it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tainted blood"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Blood that's obviously unhealthy.  You could drink it, but it will poison "
"you."
msgstr ""

