#. ~ Description of "seeping heart"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/flesh.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/flesh.json
msgid ""
"A thick mass of flesh superficially resembling a mammalian heart.  It's the "
"size of your fist and covered in dimpled grooves."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "putrid heart"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A thick, hulking mass of flesh that's easily the size of your head, "
"superficially resembling a mammalian heart and covered in ribbed grooves.  "
"It's still full of whatever passes for blood in jabberwocks, and is heavy in "
"your hands.  After everything you've seen lately, you can't help but remember"
" old sayings about eating the hearts of your enemies…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "reverberating organ"
msgid_plural "reverberating organs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of "reverberating organ"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A tubular leathery organ of an alien creature, comprised of tough muscle "
"tissue.  Dozens of deep ridges make up the slimy surface, like a disgusting "
"rendition of an accordion."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "alien grub"
msgid_plural "alien grubs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of "alien grub"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A segmented chitinous shell with curious markings is sheltering a weird alien"
" larva, squirming and wiggling around.  Theorizing what it could eventually "
"turn into, you're unsure if it is safe to keep around."
msgstr ""

