msgid_plural "scraps of poultry meat"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of "scrap of poultry meat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A tiny scrap of raw meat from a bird.  You figure that one of these should be"
" about one fifth of a portion.  Dangerous to eat as-is."
msgstr ""

